 "narration": "Pulse offers streaming and batch. Streaming opens a WebSocket at wss://api.smallest.ai/waves/v1/stt/live?model=pulse and sends PCM audio. You get partial transcripts, then a final. Batch POSTs the whole file to /waves/v1/stt/?model=pulse and returns one transcript. Streaming time to first token is about 150 milliseconds at one concurrency. Pulse Pro is pre recorded English only, and it is not a streaming model. For English end of turn detection, use model pulse-2.",
